<view class="page"><view class="page-masthead"><image class="masthead-icon" src="/assets/icons/express.png"/><view class="masthead-copy"><view class="page-title">驿站配送任务</view><view class="masthead-subtitle">送到门口，每一户都记清</view></view></view><view class="muted">整批由一名服务员接单，逐户登记送达结果。</view><empty-state wx:if="{{error}}" message="{{error}}" retry bind:retry="retry"/><view class="card" wx:for="{{list}}" wx:key="_id"><view class="section-title">批次 {{item._id}}</view><view>可配送 {{item.itemCount}} 户 · 已送达 {{item.deliveredCount}} 户</view><view>预计计件收入 ¥{{item.incomeText}}</view><button type="primary" data-id="{{item._id}}" disabled="{{busy || loading || !ready}}" bindtap="accept">接整批</button></view><empty-state wx:if="{{loading}}" message="正在加载批次…"/><empty-state wx:elif="{{!error && !list.length && !hasMore}}" message="暂时没有可接的驿站批次"/><button wx:if="{{hasMore && !loading && !error}}" bindtap="more">继续查找批次</button></view>
<privacy-popup />
